  T("review", "Review my policy", "Vague, unfair or risky clauses", "🔍", [LONG("text", "Paste the policy", "Employees may work remotely at the discretion of…")],
    "Review this policy: {text}. Table (Clause | Issue: vague / unfair / risky / missing | Suggested fix), a text section on tone and readability with an estimated reading age, and a checklist of edits to make before re-publishing.", "table, text, checklist", "Review", "Reading closely…"),
  T("scenario", "What's our rule?", "A real situation → a fair answer", "🤔", [LONG("situation", "The situation", "an engineer wants to work from Bali for 3 months")],
    "A manager asks how to handle: {situation}. Text with a fair recommended answer for the profile company, bullets of the policy gaps it exposes, a quote with a message the manager can send the employee, and a callout on legal or tax angles to check first.", "text, bullets, quote, callout", "Decide", "Weighing it up…"),
